      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": "### SLO contract\n| SLI | Definition | SLO | Window |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Availability** | good = requests that are **not 5xx** (4xx client errors excluded) | **99.5%** (allowed 5xx = 0.5%) | 30 d |\n| **Latency** | good = **TTFT \u2264 10 s** | **p95 \u2264 10 s** (allowed slow = 5%) | 30 d |\n\n**SLA (external promise, more generous than the internal SLO):** availability \u2265 99.0% per month, p95 TTFT \u2264 30 s.\n\nError budget = allowed bad fraction \u2212 observed bad fraction over the window. Burn rate = observed / allowed; 1x = budget being spent at break-even.",
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 200,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": 0
      },
      "title": "",
      "type": "text"
